## Non-negotiables

This section starts empty on purpose. The pattern: when a correction lands during a session ("no, not that" / "do it this way instead"), write the full story to `Tasks/lessons.md` under today's date, then add the active, one-line form of the rule here. Over time this becomes the list of things that keep failing or that matter enough to hold even when attention is scarce.

